meta {
  name: 10. Respond To Direct Invite
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/direct/{{inviteId}}/respond
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  inviteId: 1
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "response": "ACCEPTED"
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `POST /api/v1/invites/direct/:inviteID/respond` — Invitation recipient; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Accepts or rejects a pending direct group invitation. Only its recipient can respond. Accepting adds the recipient as an active group member.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `inviteID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive direct invitation ID (the invite object's `id`). |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <recipient-access-token>`. |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json`. |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `response` | `string` | Yes | Exactly `ACCEPTED` or `REJECTED`. |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 12,
      "status": "ACCEPTED",
      "created_at": "2026-11-06T10:00:00Z",
      "responded_at": "2026-11-06T10:05:00Z",
      "group": {"id": 1, "title": "Weekend trip"},
      "sender": {"id": 1, "name": "Owner", "avatar_attachment_id": null},
      "recipient": {"id": 2, "name": "Friend", "avatar_attachment_id": null}
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 INVITE_INVALID_ID` — `inviteID` is not a positive integer.
  - `400 DIRECT_INVITE_INVALID_RESPONSE` — Body is invalid or response is not `ACCEPTED` / `REJECTED`.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `404 DIRECT_INVITE_NOT_FOUND` — Invitation does not exist for this recipient.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group was deleted before acceptance.
  - `409 DIRECT_INVITE_NOT_PENDING` — Invitation has already been answered.
  - `409 ALREADY_GROUP_MEMBER` — Recipient is already an active group member.
  - `409 GROUP_INACTIVE` — Group is inactive and cannot accept members.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Response could not be saved.
}
